      `the day in question` IS A DATE
      `the date inserted in the order` IS A DATE
      `the order was revoked before that date` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a document that contains the data was obtained under a warrant or an order before that date` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`form 5.003 the person is required to preserve the specified computer data` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the computer data was in the person's possession or control when the person received the order`
        THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "that is in your possession or control when you receive this order"
        IF `the day in question` GREATER THAN `the date inserted in the order`
